TITLE:: RCNoteAlg
summary:: Note algorithms for orgnsms: firefly walks, tonnetz scale force fields
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCOrgnsm, Classes/RCBatch

DESCRIPTION::
Each firefly method returns the walk function an orgnsm stores under code::staticAttrs.notealg::. The functions read their parameters from the orgnsm's static attributes at every call; all searches are bounded and any failure returns the previous value.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: fireflyNote1d
1-D raga walk: code::(prev, othersNotes, origin, stattrs) → note::. Uses code::scale::, code::aroh::, code::avaroh::, code::octaves::, code::notealg_maxrandomjump::, code::notealg_maxothersjump::, code::notealg_startnotefunc::.
METHOD:: fireflyTonnetz
Flocking walk on a discrete tonnetz: code::(prev = [tpos, freqMult], others = [[tpos, freqMult, weight]...], forceField, stattrs) → [tpos, freqMult]::.
argument:: centerOfMassFromStaticAttrs
METHOD:: tonnetzPositions
Tonnetz coordinates of ratios (floats are turned into fractions with code::asFraction::).
METHOD:: scaleForceField
The force field the pieces apply during a section, built without the Rational quark.
argument:: targetPos
argument:: scaleForceFactor
argument:: scale
argument:: tuningRatios
argument:: tonnetzMultFactors
METHOD:: applyScaleForceField
code::batch.editAttr("force_field", { field })::.
